# JobRight AI Extension Development Rules

## Code Style
- Use TypeScript for all source files
- Follow strict TypeScript settings
- Use async/await for asynchronous operations
- Prefer functional programming patterns where appropriate

## Architecture
- Content scripts should be lightweight and focused on DOM interaction
- Background service worker handles all storage and API calls
- Use message passing for communication between components
- Keep UI components separate from business logic

## Security
- Never auto-fill sensitive fields (SSN, passwords, etc.)
- Encrypt sensitive profile data at rest
- Validate all user inputs
- Use Content Security Policy where applicable

## User Experience
- Always show confidence scores
- Provide clear explanations for suggestions
- Allow easy editing before accepting
- Support keyboard navigation
- Make UI accessible

## Performance
- Minimize DOM queries
- Debounce form scanning
- Cache profile data
- Lazy load heavy operations

